	(text "Encoders: Bourns PEC11R-4215F-S0024 (24 pulses, push\nswitch) for 25 mm knobs, as far apart as the enclosure's\n5 mm border and 1 mm gap allow."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 320 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "58fe6a65-9e00-45d5-9e00-48505b1ab18b")
	)
	(text "Radar: HLK-LD2402 soldered on its own 2.5 mm header, antenna side out, between the two encoders (leave it off to build without the radar).\nCheck the module's print: 1 VCC, 2 OUT, 3 GND, 4 TX, 5 RX (Hi-Link manual p. 7)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190 165 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "90947cb1-39b9-420c-9803-1260aa149ad9")
	)
	(text "Power: 5 V from the solder pads (J2) or the optional USB-C (J3), never both and never with\nthe panel's own USB. No reverse-polarity protection: mark + and - clearly. The panel is fed\nthrough J1; U1 makes 3.3 V for the co-processor, radar and SHT40."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e86ea42f-a13b-4e7a-b57c-59dc688fe0f7")
	)
	(text "Spare pins on J5 (2.54 mm pads for wires): the panel's IO40 and UART0 from H1, the\nco-processor's PA2 and PD7 (NRST), and GND. Test points TP1-TP8 (1.5 mm pads on the back):\n5 V, 3.3 V, GND, I2C and the radar's UART and OUT."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 320 160 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ec571aef-1298-4de5-9879-e6b7763987d1")
	)
	(text "Co-processor: CH32V003A4M6 (SOP-16), I2C slave to the panel; the panel polls it.\nSame pins on both boards: PC6/PC7/PC0 = key LEDs (TIM1 remap 1 PWM) or encoder 1 A/B and\nencoder 2 A; PC3/PA1/PC4 = keys 1-3 or encoder 1 push / encoder 2 B / encoder 2 push.\nFlash with a WCH-LinkE on J4 (SWIO, 3V3, GND)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f85624d1-928f-4869-b2f2-3cb29acf15c3")
	)
